{"ID":"20230927161550-80z5ro4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927161550-80z5ro4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161550-80z5ro4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161553-vn3j6sk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161553-uy3ti8n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161553-uy3ti8n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:22,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:22\u0026#125;","title":"合欢皮","type":"doc","updated":"20230927161553"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927161553-vn3j6sk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161553-vn3j6sk","updated":"20230927161553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"合欢皮名字由来，合欢皮因为到了晚上会合起来，所以看起来好像中国人所谓的结婚啦，到了晚上相亲相爱去了。"}]},{"ID":"20230927161553-15m4el3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161553-15m4el3","updated":"20230927161553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个药物，有些医生临床观察说，这个植物就是两个树枝靠在一起就会长成一个树枝。就是它粘到一欻就会长到一起，所以它用来修补肺的这个漏洞特别有效，所以肺痈之后补肺的方用合欢皮。"}]},{"ID":"20230927161553-uy3ti8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161553-uy3ti8n","updated":"20230927161553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在临床补肺方面，曹颖甫认为合欢皮比白芨有效。"}]}]}